{#- An item's image, from `imageSrc`, `imageAlt` and an optional `imageFill` crop. Assets and uploads go through picture,
    which falls back to a plain img for anything it cannot process.
    ifAsync, not if: a plain if around the async picture shortcode drops its output inside asyncEach. -#}
{%- ifAsync imageSrc -%}
{% picture { src: (imageSrc | assetPath) or imageSrc, alt: imageAlt or '', sizes: '(min-width: 48rem) 48rem, 100vw', fill: imageFill } %}
{%- endif -%}
